{"id":"asumir","lemma":"asumir","pos":"verb","rank":2660,"glosses":["to assume, take on","to assume, to suppose, to reckon"],"ipa":"/asuˈmiɾ/","conjugation":{"indicative":{"present":{"1s":"asumo","2s":"asumes","3s":"asume","1p":"asumimos","2p":"asumís","3p":"asumen"},"imperfect":{"1s":"asumía","2s":"asumías","3s":"asumía","1p":"asumíamos","2p":"asumíais","3p":"asumían"},"preterite":{"1s":"asumí","2s":"asumiste","3s":"asumió","1p":"asumimos","2p":"asumisteis","3p":"asumieron"},"future":{"1s":"asumiré","2s":"asumirás","3s":"asumirá","1p":"asumiremos","2p":"asumiréis","3p":"asumirán"},"conditional":{"1s":"asumiría","2s":"asumirías","3s":"asumiría","1p":"asumiríamos","2p":"asumiríais","3p":"asumirían"}},"subjunctive":{"present":{"1s":"asuma","2s":"asumas","3s":"asuma","1p":"asumamos","2p":"asumáis","3p":"asuman"},"imperfect":{"1s":"asumiera","2s":"asumieras","3s":"asumiera","1p":"asumiéramos","2p":"asumierais","3p":"asumieran"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"asume","3s":"asuma","1p":"asumamos","2p":"asumid","3p":"asuman"},"negative":{"2s":"asumas","3s":"asuma","1p":"asumamos","2p":"asumáis","3p":"asuman"}}},"nonFinite":{"gerund":"asumiendo","participle":"asumido"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1b/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-asumir.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ahora nadie quiere asumir la responsabilidad.","en":"Now no one wants to take responsibility.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/411003","words":[{"g":"now"},{"g":"no one"},{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"},null,{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"responsibility"}]},{"text":"Asumo que sabes quién hizo esto.","en":"I assume you know who did this.","words":[null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},{"g":"who"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"this"}]},{"text":"Asumí que era gratis.","en":"I assumed it was free.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/453911","words":[null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"free, without charge"}]},{"text":"No puedes